        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "This petition under section 482 Cr.P.C. has been preferred by the applicant praying for the following reliefs :-\n(i) to set aside the order dated 1.10.2021 passed in Cr.Revision No. 6/2021 passed by District & Sessions Judge, Jhabua.\n(ii) t"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "44a2c54329b34ee3be39007e884759b3_16",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n4. To appreciate the controversy, it is apposite to refer section 77 of the Act which reads as under :-\n3 MCRC-53269-2021 \"Section 77. Time limit for prosecution :-\nNotwithstanding anything contained in this Act, no court shall take cogniz"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a78cb5a78bec427182bf881568636ff6_17",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The aforesaid provision prescribes that the limitation period has to be counted from the date of offence and not from the date of report of food analyst or from the date of sanction of prosecution."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c4005b3ee7164d1f84bf5f438ab6fe0d_18",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "All these formalities are required to be completed within a period of one year from the date of commission of offence so that the accused may not be adversely affected."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8721f59ef0a44031abe53cde948112ae_19",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe object of prescribing the period of limitation has been clarified by the Hon'ble appex court in the case State of Punjab vs Sarwan Singh, AIR 1981 SC 1054 wherein it is held that in putting a bar of limitation on prosecutions was clear"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d57b4984c98e4ba093b7b2409d83ff77_20",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is therefore of the utmost importance that any prosecution, whether by the State or a private complainant must abide by the letter of law or take the risk of the prosecution failing on the ground of limitation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "18c3b935308c4fd78a09bdf30e6de9e6_21",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The aforesaid submission finds support from the above referred judgments relied on by the counsel for the applicant."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1be1a9799aed4069b3dedd37ff9465c9_22",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the instant case, 4 MCRC-53269-2021 clearly the date of offence is 14/09/2011 and complaint has been filed after more than three year from the date of offence which is clearly barred Deendayal Somani S/O Banshilal Somani ... vs The State"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "87f42714bacc45ba93ed03b46493ab40_23",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view aforesaid object and limitation of prosecution, learned court below has failed to appreciate the provision of limitation as enshrined under section 77 of the Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c669a21477fa44e6b11de54d1d12cac0_24",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
